{"header":{"OB_REQUEST_ID":"0483934e-de6b-476a-90a5-22c7c4b7bc7d","result.val":0,"http.code":200,"result.text":"OK"},"data":{"message":{"id":687257,"messageId":687257,"newsId":639877,"title":"Equinor ASA: Share buy-back - fourth tranche for 2026","body":"Please see below information about transactions made under the fourth tranche of\nthe 2026 share buy-back programme for Equinor ASA (OSE:EQNR, NYSE:EQNR,\nCEUX:EQNRO, TQEX:EQNRO).\n\nDate on which the buy-back tranche was announced: 28 October 2026.\n\nThe duration of the buy-back tranche: 29 October 2026 to no later than 1\nFebruary 2027.\n\nFurther information on the tranche can be found in the stock market announcement\non its commencement dated 28 October 2026, available here:\nhttps://newsweb.oslobors.no/message/684948\n\nFrom 16 November to 20 November 2026, Equinor ASA has purchased a total of\n764,879 own shares at an average price of NOK 394.3451 per share.\n\nOverview of transactions:\n\n+------------------+------------+--------------+------------+------------------+\n|Date              |Trading     |              |       Daily|                  |\n|                  |venue       |    Aggregated|    weighted|                  |\n|                  |            |  daily volume|     average|       Total daily|\n|                  |            |    (number of| share price| transaction value|\n|                  |            |       shares)|       (NOK)|             (NOK)|\n+------------------+------------+--------------+------------+------------------+\n|                  |            |              |            |                  |\n+------------------+------------+--------------+------------+------------------+\n|16 November       |OSE         |       150,000|    400.0850|     60,012,750.00|\n+------------------+------------+--------------+------------+------------------+\n|                  |CEUX        |              |            |                  |\n+------------------+------------+--------------+------